&piece title="Two voices: a mix" tags="tutorial" tier=1 label="One tune, played by two voices at once: a sine on top and a saw three octaves below it, quieter." about=&out
&twovoicesNote label="A chord in the brackets is a mix: the sound card plays what is in it at once. * .5 and * .25 are gains: how loud each voice is in the mix." about=&out

&tune step=3 0 4 7 4 0 4 7@2 5 9 12 9 5 9 12@2   # a tune
&lead s=sine loop=C5
&bass s=saw loop=C2
&out map=sample level=6 [&tune * &lead * .5, &tune * &bass * .25]
